&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Troubleshooting Tip:&lt;/strong&gt; For Expo mobile, ensure your GraphQL endpoint is accessible from physical devices by using your local IP address (e.g., &lt;a href="http://192.168.1.100:3000/api/graphql" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;http://192.168.1.100:3000/api/graphql&lt;/a&gt;) instead of localhost during development.&lt;/p&gt;

